| `domain/model/UserStatus.java` | domain | typed field for `status`, closed set (`PENDING_EMAIL_CONFIRMATION`, `ACTIVE`, `DEACTIVATED`) — value object or `enum`, `domain-modeling` decides | NEW | `domain-modeling` |
